    { heading: 'Evidence-led conclusion', body: 'Evidence-led conclusion: supervised support for deadline source reconciliation is defensible only as a bounded preparation lane with source provenance, explicit stop rules, restricted access, and owner review. This is not a recommendation to transfer legal judgment or rely on a generic checklist. The useful standard for LegalServicesOffshore.com is reconstructability: can a firm-side reviewer see what was requested, which source was used, what changed, what was not decided, and who accepted the handoff? A prudent pilot expands only when those questions are answerable from the record. The sources inform that discipline; they do not replace the firm’s professional analysis.' }
